      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimwenu chaObadiya. Mwanta Yehova nateni dehi Edomi, nindi, Tunatiyi dehi nsaŋu yakudi Yehova, muluwa anamutemeshi dehi munyuza nakwila nindi, Nyamukenu, tumunyamukilenu, tumwasi njita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya, nakukeheshi dehi mukachi kanyuza, eyi anakudiwuli nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi washakama munyaji yamwilola, washakama kwiwulu, wahoshaŋa mumuchima weyi, neyi, Wakanhulumuna kunu kwiwulu anshikiji heseki hinyi? wanta weyi wadinka kumuchima wunakudimbi kweyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela wukujindama hewulu neyi mbuulu, hela wakaala chaala cheyi hewulu hakachi katutumbwa, nakakuholojahu. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi wakisika dehi! Neyi amakombi enza kudeyi, neyi akwakubuwa enza nawufuku, hiyadi kwiya iye-e nichiyadi kuwaninawuku? Neyi akwakukumuna nyikabu yavinyu enza kudeyi, hiyadi kushiyahu nyikabu yikwawuku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esawu o chamusandolawu dehi! O chamwekeshawu dehi yuma yindi yalema yadiŋi yakusweka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwenu ejima watiyaŋeni nawu anakuhaŋi dehi ndo nikuŋinza. Akwenu wadiŋi nawu chamwena zo-o anakudimbi, anemiki mushindu hadeyi; adiilaŋa yakudya yeyi anakutili muhetu; eyi kushinshikamu nehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Ifuku odu nibuli kujilumuna akwamaana kulonda amani muEdomi? Niakwakashinshi nibuli kuyimanisha kumpidi yaEsawu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Temani, ayilobu jeyi akatiya nyima ngwa, kulonda antu ejima adi kumpidi yaEsawu akayimanishi to-o nakuyŋahola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsonyi jakakubuta wi-i nandombu jiwamuzuŋishili mana kweyi Yakoba, eyi akakufumishahu chahaya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku diwemeni hahalehi nayena, hefuku datutiluwu yuma yindi kudi enyi, deliluwu antu akwacheŋi hiyakwijila muyisu yakumpwembu jindi, dabalula balulawu Yerusalema nayinjikijilu yakusakula nachu, welili kweyi neyi wadibomba nawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wutala ifuku damana kweyi mwifuku dakumonayi kukalaku, bayi wuzaŋajala nansaŋu yawanyana kaYuda mwifuku dakujilumukawuku; bayi wuhosha chakudinka wanta mwifuku dakumonawu yihuŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wiŋila muchisu champwembu yawantu ami mwifuku dakuhalwawuku; mwalala, bayi wutala makabi awu mwifuku dakuhalwawuku, bayi mukwata makasa hyuma yawu mwifuku dakuhalwawuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mwimana kumaakenu nakuyijikilila antu indi akupulukaku; antu indi akushalahu mwifuku dakumona yihuŋu bayi muyihanonaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ifuku daYehova didi kwakwihi, keŋa diwani nyuza yejima. Eyi akakukoŋa muwunakoŋi akwenu; yuma yiwuneli akakulubwilayi hanamutu weyeyi aweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa chimunanwi enu hampidi yami yajila, dimu nawa mwakanwina nyuza yejima hefuku hefuku, mwalala akanwa, akatoboka, akekala neyi hiyadiŋi nikwokuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa kumpidi yaZiyona kwakekala akapuluka, yakekala yajila; niakwamutaŋa waYakoba akaheta mahetawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwamutaŋa waYakoba akekala kesi, akwamutaŋa waYosefu akekala mulaŋu wakesi, akwamutaŋa waEsawu akekala ntotu; wena akabidimaŋa mukachi kawu, akayilasha; kumutaŋa waEsawu hikwakashala nawa cheŋi antuku; muloŋa Yehova nachihoshi dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa akukabeta kakuchidiilu akaheta mpidi yaEsawu, awa akunkulu akaheta aFwilistinu; akaheta nimpata yaEfweremi, nimpata yaSamariya; Benjamini wakaheta Gileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wukoli wanidi izaza dawanyana kaIsarela ekala mukachi kawaKenani, akaheta mpata yashika kuZarefwati; wukoli wamuYerusalema wudi kuSefwaradi wakaheta nyikala yakukabeta kakuchidiilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwakwamwina akakanduka mpidi yaZiyona kulonda akasompeshi mpidi yaEsawu; wanta wakekala waYehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
